   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ❓ FAQ\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: How many system messages can I use?**\n",
    "A: Just one, but it combines with conversation history.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: What's the ideal prompt length?**\n",
    "A: As short as possible while being clear. Tokens = money!\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: Does position of examples matter?**\n",
    "A: Yes! Put the most important examples at the BEGINNING and END."
   ]
  },
