    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ✅ Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "You now understand:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Tokens** are subword units that determine cost and context\n",
    "2. **System prompts** set context and personality\n",
    "3. **Few-shot learning** teaches by example (2-5 examples)\n",
    "4. **Chain of Thought** improves reasoning\n",
    "5. **Clear, specific prompts** get better results\n",
